To run and test this project, you will have to run the server itself, wait until the server starts properly, typically 15-20 seconds, then you can tests against it.

Agentuity uses UV -- you must always use UV to run. For instance: `uv run server.py` will start the project.

The recommended way is using `agentuity dev` to run locally.